# @name huggingface
# Base URL
@apiUrl = http://localhost

# Common variables
@harvard = harvard.wav 
@angry = angry-man.wav 

### Health Check
GET {{apiUrl}}/health

### List All Tasks
GET {{apiUrl}}/tasks

### AUDIO PIPELINES

### @name audio-classification
POST {{apiUrl}}:5401/audio-audio-classification/run
Content-Type: application/json

< ../data/audio_b64/angry-man.wav.b64

# Response
# {
#   "result": [
